- public boolean isValid(String s)
- requires s != null
- requires s.length() >= 1 && s.length() <= 10000
- requires (\forall int i; 0 <= i && i < s.length(); s.charAt(i) == '(' || s.charAt(i) == ')' || s.charAt(i) == '{' || s.charAt(i) == '}' || s.charAt(i) == '[' || s.charAt(i) == ']')
- ensures \result == true if the input string is valid, false otherwise